        "id": "ZedW",
        "name": "Living Shadow",
        "description": "<font color='#FF9900'>Passive:</font> Zed gains energy whenever he and his shadows strike an enemy with the same ability. Energy can only be gained once per cast ability.<br><br><font color='#FF9900'>Active:</font> Zed's shadow dashes forward, remaining in place for a few seconds. Reactivating Living Shadow will cause Zed to switch positions with this shadow.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Zed gains <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">30/35/40/45/50 Energy</span> whenever he and his <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Shadows</span> strike an enemy with the same Ability.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Zed's <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Shadow</span> dashes forward, remaining in place for 5 seconds. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recasting</span> this Ability will cause Zed to switch positions with this <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Shadow</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Energy</span> can only be gained once per Ability usage.</span>",
